	"title"		"SpireTalk: Living Ancients"
	"description"		"Talk to the eight Ancients and the Merchant. Every NPC answers in character on your own API key, remembers what you said across runs, strikes deals with you, hands you a keepsake relic that grows with the relationship, and looks back on your run when it ends.

[h2]What it does[/h2]
[list]
[*] A new [b]Talk[/b] option on every Ancient's page and a [b]Talk[/b] button in the shop. Three lines per visit: pick a suggested reply or type your own.
[*] [b]Deals[/b] - an NPC may ask something of you (reach the next act alive, no potions until then, spend 150 gold at the shop...). Answer with a button; the game judges it. Kept: affection and gold. Broken: a disappointed line, nothing more.
[*] [b]Keepsakes[/b] - once an NPC likes you they give you their keepsake, a relic with levels I/II/III that follow the relationship and engravings from every deal you keep. Nine of them, one per NPC.
[*] [b]Ancient relics on the shelf[/b] - an Ancient who likes you may leave one of their own relics with the Merchant for you.
[*] [b]Epilogue[/b] - when a run ends, the NPC who knew you best says a few words about it.
[*] Every line is judged by that NPC's own values (-3..+3). Tiers: hostile / stranger / friendly / close / devoted. Temperament setting: lenient / normal / strict.
[*] Rewards (relic reroll, gold, healing, a potion, a shop discount) are validated by the mod and applied through the game's own commands - the AI only narrates.
[*] With [b]Ancient Affection[/b] installed the same affection number is used; without it the mod keeps its own.
[*] Single player only.
[/list]

[h2]Setup[/h2]
Click the mushie in the top-right corner of the main menu. Enter an API endpoint, your key and a model id, press Test. OpenRouter (default), OpenAI or a local Ollama all work. There is no account: the NPCs run on the Yumina engine inside the game, and the mod connects to nothing but the endpoint you configure.

Each NPC is a Yumina card (a JSON file). Drop your own into %APPDATA%\SlayTheSpire2\spiretalk\cards\ to replace a persona.

Requires BaseLib. No AI-generated art. Engine: https://github.com/lovetimo0421/yumina-oss

[h2]中文[/h2]
和八位远古先民以及商人聊天。每位 NPC 都有自己的性格和跨局记忆，会向你提约定（活着走到下一章、不喝药水、在商店花够钱……），关系到了会把自己的信物交给你——一件随关系升级、守约就多一道刻痕的遗物；先民还可能把自己的遗物托给商人留给你；一局结束时关系最深的那位会写几句回顾。每次拜访三句，可选可打字。只需要你自己的 API Key（OpenRouter / OpenAI / Ollama），不需要任何账号。装了 Ancient Affection 时直接用它的好感度。仅单人模式。需要 BaseLib。"
	"changenote"		"0.3.0 - the Yumina engine runs inside the game (own API key only); deals, keepsake relics, Ancient relics on the Merchant's shelf, epilogue, temperament"
